# Copy into the build folder as _redirects. Path-only redirects, evaluated before
# the assets. A plain destination keeps the request's query string; a destination
# with its own query drops it (traps.md 19). No host or query matching: those go
# in a Redirect Rule or the Worker.
# Limits on the free plan: 2,000 static + 100 dynamic rules.

# Renamed posts (never break a published URL)
/old-slug/            /new-slug/                  301

# WordPress leftovers
/wp-login.php         /                           301
/wp-admin/*           /                           301
/posts/               /archive/                   301

# Short links to forms
/r/feedback           https://tally.so/r/XXXXXX   301
/r/feedback/          https://tally.so/r/XXXXXX   301
